{#- The compressed form of a rule, for P1_summary / P2_summary.

    The grant's worked example (Prefix Compiler PDF p2) summarises P1 as
    "altitude limited to 5-120m AGL; cruise speed <= 12 m/s." - a clause per
    rule, joined with "; ". The schedule is kept: a summary that drops the time
    window says the rule is permanent, which is the defect the long form had.
    ASCII "<=" rather than the grant's U+2264, so the token counter's byte bound
    stays tight and every tokenizer sees the same characters.
-#}
{% block core %}{% endblock %}{% if window %} ({{ window }}){% endif %}{% if soft %} (soft){% endif %}
